---
title: Browser SDK · one browser stream through disconnect, pause, and credential expiry
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant rt as Top-document runtime
  participant ing as Browser ingestion
  participant cp as Control plane

  rt->>ing: new browser_stream_id · export_sequence from 1
  loop while ready
    rt->>ing: redacted batch
    ing-->>rt: highest contiguous export_sequence
  end
  alt transport disconnect, credential unexpired
    rt->>ing: reconnect with the same credential
    Note over rt,ing: Same activation, attachment, stream, and buffer.<br/>Retransmit from the last contiguous acknowledgement.
  else pause
    rt->>ing: flush
    ing-->>rt: acknowledgement
    rt->>ing: close · terminal sequence
    Note over rt,ing: Resume reopens this stream at that watermark.
  else credential expired or rejected
    rt->>cp: fresh attestation and credential
    cp-->>rt: new activation · new document attachment
    Note over rt: Discards the old stream's<br/>unsent and unacknowledged records.
    rt->>ing: new browser_stream_id · export_sequence from 1 · fresh baseline
    Note over ing: The old stream records no terminal sequence.<br/>Its acknowledged watermark ends it.
  end
